  // Retired pre-1.1 Lightkeeper access chain, kept only as disabled anchors.
  // All seven wiki pages carry {{Historical content}} (issue #365), and
  // tarkov.dev dropped the IDs with the rest of the line (#886 above). They are
  // re-added from the same archived regular-mode data, unchanged except for
  // `disabled: true`, because Getting Acquainted's only recorded start edge
  // points at Knock-Knock: an addition may not reference a task that exists
  // nowhere, while an edge into a disabled task keeps Getting Acquainted
  // `unknown` for consumers that filter disabled tasks (docs/TASK_AVAILABILITY.md).
  // Consumers must keep filtering these out.

