  // Placeholder tasks (all modes): quests the wiki
  // documents but no source exposes BSG task/objective IDs for yet. IDs are
  // synthetic and identity-based: task 'placeholder_<wiki title slug>',
  // objectives '<taskId>_objNN' in wiki order, so they never collide with 24-hex
  // BSG IDs. Every placeholder is tracked in
  // https://github.com/tarkovtracker-org/tarkov-data-overlay/issues/507; when a
  // real ID is known, replace the entry, record the placeholder -> real mapping
  // there and migrate stored progress (plan in the issue). Definitions come from
  // each linked wiki page. Map, item and trader references use real IDs.
  //
  // Only explicit "Unlocks N-M after completion of X" Requirements lines become
  // taskRequirements; infobox `previous` chains are not proof (AGENTS.md), so
  // most placeholders appear available. Loyalty-level gates are omitted too:
  // trader requirement IDs must embed a 24-hex task ID. The issue lists the
  // wiki chain and LL gates per task.

